 "words": 139,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Gathered around him in the quiet hall",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They asked about the time of the kingdom's call",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He spoke of seasons only the Father knows",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Times set apart by his own authority",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will receive power when the Spirit comes",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Witnesses in Jerusalem, Judea, Samaria",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Carrying the light to the ends of the earth",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As they watched in wonder he was lifted high",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A cloud took him from their sight and memory",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Two men in white robes stood beside them then",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Speaking of the promise of his return",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will receive power when the Spirit comes",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Witnesses in Jerusalem, Judea, Samaria",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Carrying the light to the ends of the earth",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Why do you stand here looking into the sky",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He who has gone into heaven will return",
